        {
          "id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:task:banking77",
          "source_id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1",
          "source_span": {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 254,
            "quote": "本材料由 AlgoFactory 项目编写。数据来自 PolyAI 的 BANKING77，论文 Efficient Intent Detection with Dual Sentence Encoders（Casanueva 等，2020），https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.04807，许可 CC BY 4.0。任务是英文文本多分类，输入 text，目标 intent 是 77 类已知客服意图；不包含自动回复、中文效果或未知意图检测。"
          },
          "type": "Task",
          "name": "BANKING77 客服意图分类",
          "task_type": "multiclass_classification",
          "constraints": {
            "candidate_limit": 2,
            "max_repairs_per_candidate": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:capability:intent",
          "source_id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1",
          "source_span": {
            "start": 256,
            "end": 424,
            "quote": "客服意图分类能力接收英文文本和训练标签，输出意图类别及按固定类别顺序排列的概率。适用条件是有监督标签的文本多分类。使用固定数据版本与类别映射；仅在训练集拟合词表和 IDF。评价指标为 Macro-F1 与 Accuracy，同时报告逐类 Precision/Recall/F1 和混淆矩阵；阈值通过训练/验证基线校准并在最终测试前冻结。"
          },
          "type": "Capability",
          "name": "客服意图分类能力",
          "description": "英文客服文本的已知意图分类",
          "inputs": [
            "text",
            "训练标签 intent"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "意图类别",
            "77 类概率"
          ],
          "conditions": {
            "task_types": [
              "multiclass_classification"
            ],
            "data_kind": "text",
            "requirements": [
              "英文监督标签",
              "训练集拟合词表和 IDF",
              "固定类别映射"
            ]
          },
          "metrics": [
            "macro_f1",
            "accuracy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:text_logistic",
          "source_id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1",
          "source_span": {
            "start": 426,
            "end": 628,
            "quote": "TF-IDF + Logistic Regression 属于线性文本分类模型，可以实现上述客服意图分类能力。使用词级一元和二元 TF-IDF、sublinear_tf=True、max_features=30000；LogisticRegression 的 C=4.0、max_iter=500、random_state=42。特征提取与分类器放在同一 Pipeline，适用于上述英文文本多分类任务。"
          },
          "type": "Algorithm",
          "name": "TF-IDF + Logistic Regression",
          "family": "线性文本分类",
          "applicability": {
            "task_types": [
              "multiclass_classification"
            ],
            "data_kind": "text",
            "requirements": [
              "英文监督标签",
              "训练集拟合词表和 IDF",
              "固定类别映射"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:dependency:sklearn",
          "source_id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1",
          "source_span": {
            "start": 630,
            "end": 745,
            "quote": "实现依赖 scikit-learn，版本约束 >=1.5,<2。本阶段比较两个候选，每个候选最多修复两次；Docker 执行预算为 120 秒、2 CPU、4096 MiB，禁网。本材料描述待验证方案，不提供模型成绩或已验证经验。"
          },
          "type": "Dependency",
          "name": "scikit-learn",
          "package": "scikit-learn",
          "version_constraint": ">=1.5,<2"
        },
        {
          "id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:text_nb",
          "source_id": "source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1",
          "source_span": {
            "start": 747,
            "end": 911,
            "quote": "TF-IDF + MultinomialNB 属于朴素贝叶斯文本分类模型，可以实现上述客服意图分类能力。使用与线性模型相同的训练集拟合 TF-IDF，特征非负，MultinomialNB 的 alpha=0.1。若验证集指标不达标，最多按预先固定的 alpha=0.05、0.01 尝试优化；不改变数据划分、标签映射或验收门槛。"
          },
          "type": "Algorithm",
          "name": "TF-IDF + MultinomialNB",
          "family": "朴素贝叶斯文本分类",
          "applicability": {
            "task_types": [
              "multiclass_classification"
            ],
            "data_kind": "text",
            "requirements": [
              "英文监督标签",
              "训练集拟合词表和 IDF",
              "固定类别映射"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
